                        "entry_id": "1d295ec9-a655-314a-a324-964e7e7ed808",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A component of a neural network that determines the probability that each member of a set of predictors will be selected."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c4c6d72-ca95-45d2-9d5f-f24ebb6ae7cf",
                                "sense_id": "f7cf5f3b-2887-3e6d-a965-5931b525e1cb",
                                "text": "In the same spirit, one can use a neural network called the gater to select which one out of several expert networks will be used to compute the output, given the current input."
